[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 23821.11, "timestamp": "06:37:01", "text": "你好。我们找到了这枚银币。漂亮的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23824.868, "timestamp": "06:37:04", "text": "确定那个人只是等等，你是吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23828.628, "timestamp": "06:37:08", "text": "不，如果你指的是那位穿白衣服的先生的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23829.91, "timestamp": "06:37:09", "text": "我相信他就在旁边"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23833.51, "timestamp": "06:37:13", "text": "知道了。谢谢。等等，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23836.708, "timestamp": "06:37:16", "text": "不，我可能做过。你给了我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23838.788, "timestamp": "06:37:18", "text": "这是正确的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23841.11, "timestamp": "06:37:21", "text": "嘿，火花。谢谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23861.35, "timestamp": "06:37:41", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23875.51, "timestamp": "06:37:55", "text": "哦，很好。那么，他是什么时候去的？"}]